kind: skit
id: all-rise
title: All Rise, Lightly Browned
about: Cue conducts a courtroom rehearsal in the junk drawer. The toaster is the only one who knows when to stand.

[scene 1]
scribe: "Court is in session. All rise."
gruff: "I am standing."
tabby: "So am I."
scribe: "Then who just went up?"

# Hold through the scene change. Cue follows the toast with his eyes.
[scene 2]
tabby: "One slice. Very straight back."
scribe: "Will the witness please take the stand?"
gruff: "It's on the stand. You're reading the recipe."
scribe: "I see. Both sides may now be heard."

# The turn belongs to Tabby. Gruff waits for the second side.
[scene 3]
tabby: "This side says crunch."
gruff: "Turn it over."
tabby: "Crunch."
scribe: "First time both sides have agreed."
